imp-gmail works from real Gmail evidence returned by gog: search results, message IDs, thread IDs, sanitized bodies, metadata, labels, attachments, drafts, URLs, dry-run output, and exact gog error text. It is for grounded inbox search, message/thread reading, attachment listing, draft creation/update, and explicit send workflows.

